# Dependencies
**/node_modules/
**/venv/
**/.venv/
**/env/

# Secrets
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Python cache
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.pyd
**/.pytest_cache/

# Frontend / build output
**/dist/
**/build/

# Logs
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
**/pnpm-debug.log*

# IDE
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/

# OS
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/Desktop.ini

# Temporary files
**/*.tmp
**/*.temp
**/*.bak

# Runtime session data
**/isolated_workspaces/*
!**/isolated_workspaces/.gitkeep

# Generated RAG files
**/rag_store.json
**/rag_vectors.npy

# Scratch/runtime files
**/scratch/